# Spreadsheet changelog

The live Opendoor model is a Google Sheet. Git will not see those edits unless you record them.

After **any** write to the spreadsheet (formulas, values, notes, formats, charts, or row/column insert/delete), append a dated entry to `CHANGELOG.md` before finishing. Do not skip small cell edits.

Each entry must include:

- Tab and A1 range
- Insert/delete: dimension, start index, count
- Formulas: before → after (one template is enough if copied across columns)
- Data values changed, and why
- Side effects (charts, notes, number formats) if you noticed them

Use the template at the top of `CHANGELOG.md`. One heading per change-set, not per cell.
